/target
/_package/target
/_package/deb
# Package skeleton: only DEBIAN/ (control + maintainer scripts) is source. The rest
# of _package/hqcam is staged at build time — copy-supporting-files.sh copies the
# units/scripts/confs in from _scripts/ and _tooling/, and _release.sh drops the
# compiled binaries into usr/local/bin. Tracking DEBIAN/ lets a fresh clone (the
# sp-builder on Frasier) build the deb.
/_package/hqcam/*
!/_package/hqcam/DEBIAN/
